    "created_at": "2019-05-14T03:52:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-05-14T03:52:22Z",
    "body": "Update: In the context of `window.open`, if you don't queue a task for thh JS url exec, you get an error with [this test](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/bb11ac51f133591d7759c991ed822b02db05f897/html/browsers/the-window-object/window-open-noopener.html#L114) because `this.checkValues is not a function` inside the JS url passed to `open`.\r\n\r\nThat's because the tests only sets `checkValues` on the return value of `open` after the call to `open`. So the test seems to strongly expect that the JS url is only executed in a subsequent task, so that the current task gets a change to set `checkValues`.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
